      "message": "Patryk,\n\nI booted the firmware w/ this CL (SHA HW ACCELERATOR) and w/o this CL to compare the timestamp delta between `Verifying RW image` and `RW verify OK`.\n\nThe [performance](https://screenshot.googleplex.com/48EbwvRWpEmCZDN) without this CL vs. the [performance](https://screenshot.googleplex.com/BXnz92pqysn8X3R) with this CL show that the delta between `Verifying RW image` and `RW verify OK` improves from a mean of 471.9 msecs to 146.1 msecs. The rebooting of the firmware was repeated 9 times. This is a significant improvement.",
